Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to\Nget help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way the best that we\Nknow. With tears and doubts and tone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go. The
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,page within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,King has just been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They've defeated the Toby\NRobo and the lead performers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.92,0:02:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting quite serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still two monsters out\Nthere who can stop the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It would take a miracle to defeat Bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But they've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.50,0:03:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The struggle between Luffy\Nand Kaido grows in intensity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the battle may have\Nan unexpected consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kaido is defeated, his\Nflame clouds will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.14,0:03:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This will cause Onigashima to crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and the explosives in its basement\Nwill destroy the entire capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the tens of thousands\Nof helpless citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,enjoying the Fyre Festival\Nwill be incinerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not touching the flower capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back where you belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Into the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.18,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To make matters worse, Kanjuro\Ncrafted a massive flame monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.76,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This manifestation of the Kurozumi\Nclan's grudge heads toward
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,the castle basements threatening\Nto detonate its entire arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless Yamato can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That fire monster will\Nshow up any second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And Roki's blocking the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nget in a fight and grab
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the key from him and\Npull that massive lever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.88,0:04:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you cover me, Fuga?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fouga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fouga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fouga! Fouga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Fouga!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fouga!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep Rookie busy for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fouga! Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.36,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bodies back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, that's a relief, but how\Nthe hell does that even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get both of you\Nto chop her right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.90,0:05:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We got enough problems to deal with!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like my skull-bomb grass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's got a bounty of 200 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess this is our lucky day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so dead! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If the bad guys don't get\Nme, then the fire will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go, Sir Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You must save Kiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.52,0:06:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master Keen, I won't make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll leave you both and\Nget out of here on my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did I even bother coming here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid suicidal samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It is time to be with honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.24,0:06:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sacrifice yourself\Nto take responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's your culture,\Nbut I don't like it one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll survive crawling with\Nsnot dripping out of my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what it takes, it's worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die with dignity, then\Nwho'd be here to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, sir Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just holding on to rain\Nshouldn't be enough for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to him, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is Iso doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we piss off Whitebeard's\Nold crew somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an ex-captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco was here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Iso.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost again. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.34,0:07:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll open your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We can catch up as much as we want\Nlater, once our country is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As your brother, I won't\Nallow you to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of here,\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So live.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly believe in Straw\NHat Luffy, then you must survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, big brother. You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.02,0:08:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of those two! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, Hamlet? Of\Ncourse! Let's go! And away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.26,0:09:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to depart on a new journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.22,0:09:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.14,0:09:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No one passes through! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut fire first!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.57,0:10:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now undo the paralysis jutsu! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you undo yours first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, you're a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stubborn to the bitter end!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But your jutsu will be undone\Nonce you burn to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the fire's Lord Odin faced!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.85,0:10:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is but a summer breeze in comparison!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm in a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki is alive And the\Nfools on this island will soon be
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.83,0:10:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead. It's literally music to my ears.\NWhat's taking you so long, Fukurokuju?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here\Nbefore this place explodes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, is anything the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, just thinking Say, while we're\Nhere Why not play that song for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the one, it's my favorite\NI haven't heard it in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.75,0:10:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They got Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.43,0:11:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fuck it, Inby! Inby!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.59,0:11:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We got no reason to fight those guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.59,0:11:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough luck, Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a nuisance and\Na waste of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.71,0:11:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems that Pooh ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have Nico Robin in custody yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We were interrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All the lead performers were defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst generation is still\Nfighting an uphill battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but if they manage to pull this off,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be quite the story indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.99,0:12:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be a massive upset\Nin the balance of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One that would fan the flames of every
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,little fire we're trying\Nto put out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens at the end of this battle\Nwill set the course for our next age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.25,0:12:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's certainly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is mankind even capable of more than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Try that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.01,0:13:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh! Go start gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.67,0:14:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Napcom, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hear Gum-Gum one more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.33,0:14:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Better get used to it, Rockside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to have some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One more round? Haven't\Nyou had enough already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,take it easy you are\Nwe get to drink one day
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.47,0:15:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,a year i'm gonna catch\Nit up today just let me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,have my fun it's back\Nto suffering after this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you, Arachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.99,0:15:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you cut it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Public officials could\Nbe watching us right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're setting up the skyships.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.45,0:15:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The festival's about to wrap up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.41,0:16:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all the lanterns!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.59,0:16:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Write down a wish to your ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll see it up in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just what to wish for!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and write one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.81,0:16:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why they call them sky ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they go all the way to heaven beyond\Nthe sky, where our lost loved ones are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think Daddy's\Ngoing to read my wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he'll be happy to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.73,0:17:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you boozing it up right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is drinking. It's the fire\Nfestival in the capital. We were
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.27,0:17:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,supposed to have a party on Onigashima\Ntoo until you screwed that up
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,now do you want some or what you\Ndon't have a care in the world do you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me you're drunk already this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,is just a little sip I ain't drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so mean to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked so hard on this\Nparty and you ruined it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:17:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're drunk off your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with letting loose a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.56,0:18:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed\Nto fight me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not use this as an excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.41,0:18:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't made myself weak at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm showing you that I accept you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kum-Kum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Drunken Grandinbabla!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.69,0:19:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really feeling it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I acknowledge your strength, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the first person who's been able\Nto go toe-to-toe with me in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning on two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this place!\NWhat a mess everything's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,ruined i've been having\Nfun going wild but now my
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Castle's all screwed up.\NLook at me. I can't even.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.27,0:20:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,save my own home what do\Ni even What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta start from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.17,0:20:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It took five whole years to\Nbuild this place, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.19,0:20:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That hit really hurt! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just pretending\Nto be drunk or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.47,0:20:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I started my own business and\Nsold weapons all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I even made the world's\Nstrongest army with smile fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.91,0:21:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my best, but it\Nstill wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a stupid mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.23,0:21:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.57,0:21:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.01,0:21:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is the sign I\Nshould just call it quits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Rick, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am killing it, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister Demolition Brass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He is all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.51,0:21:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm done. I'm done. Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, where the hell are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.15,0:21:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:21:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.97,0:22:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I've done turns to crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.01,0:22:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be alone right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's too late for you to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.31,0:22:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.03,0:22:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.65,0:22:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Magua!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.11,0:22:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, you truck, take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.59,0:22:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,His Haki keeps getting stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I like getting drunk, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.71,0:23:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying this over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.99,0:24:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.57,0:24:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunda-lis!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.21,0:24:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock-at-lis!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.87,0:24:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnet-sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.57,0:24:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.23,0:24:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.05,0:24:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.41,0:24:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.79,0:24:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.70,0:24:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.99,0:24:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.23,0:24:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.05,0:24:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.37,0:24:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.45,0:25:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This year's reverie has\Nbeen a cursed affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.41,0:25:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords of the\NSea program was abolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.97,0:25:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation with Alabasta\Nwas most unfortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.35,0:25:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Revolutionary Army\Ninvaded the Holy Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.25,0:25:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in lamenting it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.23,0:25:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, the land of Wano is\Nour most pressing concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.29,0:25:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle has certainly had more\Ntwists and turns than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.53,0:25:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our best opportunity to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.11,0:25:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.77,0:25:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll catch Nico Robin somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.83,0:25:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kaido and Big Mom there,\Ndeath could come for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.49,0:25:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an excuse to wipe\Nout our inconveniences.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.61,0:25:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We will erase them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.63,0:26:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.47,0:26:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll erase the existence of that\NDevil Fruit before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.79,0:26:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain combat readiness\Nuntil further notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.63,0:26:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships remain on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.75,0:26:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.25,0:26:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.03,0:26:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.37,0:26:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a giant shadow. A shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.37,0:26:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.11,0:26:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea, sir. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.13,0:26:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.69,0:26:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.71,0:26:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.03,0:26:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Even to those who know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.49,0:26:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hardly more than a legend now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.27,0:27:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It hasn't awakened for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.77,0:27:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You think we still have cause to fear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.29,0:27:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government gave it another name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.71,0:27:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That is proof that the fruit is a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.01,0:27:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason\Nsomeone would do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.79,0:27:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,To hide its name from\Nhistory, it must be erased.
